{"seq":3,"slug":"decision-model","title":"决策模型：状态、行动与结果","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/foundations/decision-model","wordCount":1412,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"决策模型-状态-行动与结果\">决策模型：状态、行动与结果</h1><p>一个人要不要带伞出门，这件小事拆开来看有清晰的结构：他能做的事（带伞、不带伞）是<strong>行动</strong>，天气（下雨、不下雨）是他左右不了也未必确知的<strong>状态</strong>，而「淋湿」「白拿一把伞」「干爽且轻装」则是行动与状态相遇后落到他头上的<strong>结果</strong>。决策论把几乎所有单人决策都还原成这三个要素，排成一张表格。这张表格朴素得近乎显然，却是此后每一个效用函数、每一条决策规则、每一个悖论得以精确表述的公共坐标系。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>一个决策问题由三个集合与一张映射构成：行动集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>m</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A=\\{a_1,\\dots,a_m\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>、状态集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mo>…</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S=\\{s_1,\\dots,s_n\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\">…</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>、结果集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，以及一个把「行动—状态」对映到结果的函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">o=f(a_i,s_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。把它排成矩阵，行是行动、列是状态、格子是结果，就得到决策矩阵。理性选择的问题，就变成「按什么规则从这些行里挑一行」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[决策问题] --&gt; B[行动集 A: 我能做什么]&#10;  A --&gt; C[状态集 S: 世界可能怎样]&#10;  A --&gt; D[结果 O = f 行动,状态]&#10;  C --&gt; E{我对状态知道多少}&#10;  E --&gt;|每个状态概率已知| F[风险: 用期望效用]&#10;  E --&gt;|状态已知概率未知| G[不确定/模糊]&#10;  E --&gt;|连状态都列不全| H[无知]&#10;  E --&gt;|状态唯一确定| I[确定: 直接比结果]\">flowchart TD\n  A[决策问题] --&gt; B[行动集 A: 我能做什么]\n  A --&gt; C[状态集 S: 世界可能怎样]\n  A --&gt; D[结果 O = f 行动,状态]\n  C --&gt; E{我对状态知道多少}\n  E --&gt;|每个状态概率已知| F[风险: 用期望效用]\n  E --&gt;|状态已知概率未知| G[不确定/模糊]\n  E --&gt;|连状态都列不全| H[无知]\n  E --&gt;|状态唯一确定| I[确定: 直接比结果]</pre><p>以带伞为例，把结果先粗略地用效用数字标出（越大越好），得到下表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>行动 \\ 状态</th>\n<th>下雨</th>\n<th>不下雨</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>带伞</td>\n<td>6（干但累赘）</td>\n<td>5（白带）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不带伞</td>\n<td>0（淋湿）</td>\n<td>10（轻装干爽）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"四种信息处境决定用哪套工具\">四种信息处境决定用哪套工具</h2><p>同一张矩阵，配上不同的信息，就是完全不同的决策问题。决策论按「我对状态知道多少」把处境分成四档，这个分类决定了后面该调用哪一章的工具。</p>\n<p><strong>确定性</strong>：状态唯一（或行动直接决定结果），决策退化为在结果集上比大小，只要偏好是一个完备的排序即可。<strong>风险</strong>：每个状态有一个已知的概率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，这时可对每行算期望效用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>U</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mtext> </mtext><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">EU(a_i)=\\sum_j p_j\\, u(f(a_i,s_j))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1858em;vertical-align:-0.4358em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>，选最大者——这正是<a href=\"../utility/expected-utility\">期望效用理论</a>与整个「效用」章的战场。<strong>不确定性/模糊</strong>：状态清楚，但概率无法给定或只能给一个区间，标准期望效用失去输入，需要<a href=\"../debates/ambiguity-uncertainty\">模糊与奈特不确定性</a>里的专门模型。<strong>无知</strong>：连状态空间都列不全，是最难的一档，本 hub 只作提示。</p>\n<h2 id=\"没有概率时的决策规则\">没有概率时的决策规则</h2><p>风险处境有期望效用可用，但在纯不确定（有状态无概率）下，哲学家提出过几条只看结果矩阵、不需概率的规则。它们各自编码了一种性格。</p>\n<p><strong>最大最小（maximin）</strong>：对每个行动看它最差的结果，选「最差结果最好」的行动，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>i</mi></msub><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\max_i \\min_j u(f(a_i,s_j))</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span></span></span></span></span>。这是极度谨慎者的规则，只盯着灾难下限。<strong>最大最大（maximax）</strong>：反过来看每个行动最好的结果并取其最大，是乐观者的规则。<strong>Hurwicz 准则</strong>用一个乐观系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\in[0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span> 把两者加权：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><msub><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>j</mi></msub><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha\\max_j u+(1-\\alpha)\\min_j u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">max</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 退回 maximin。<strong>最小最大后悔（minimax regret）</strong>：先把每格换成「本可得到的最好结果减去此格结果」的后悔值，再对后悔矩阵做 maximin，刻画的是「事后最不想拍大腿」的心态。<strong>Laplace 准则</strong>则干脆假设无知即等概率，退回期望效用。</p>\n<p>下表把带伞例子按各规则算一遍（用上面的效用），可见规则不同、结论也可能不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>规则</th>\n<th>带伞的评分</th>\n<th>不带伞的评分</th>\n<th>选择</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大最小</td>\n<td>min(6,5)=5</td>\n<td>min(0,10)=0</td>\n<td>带伞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>最大最大</td>\n<td>max(6,5)=6</td>\n<td>max(0,10)=10</td>\n<td>不带伞</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Laplace（等概率）</td>\n<td>(6+5)/2=5.5</td>\n<td>(0+10)/2=5</td>\n<td>带伞</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"支配-决策树与序贯选择\">支配、决策树与序贯选择</h2><p>有些结论不依赖任何概率或规则就能下：如果行动 A 在每一个状态下的结果都不差于 B、且至少在一个状态下严格更好，就说 A <strong>支配</strong>（dominate）B，任何理性主体都不该选 B。支配是决策论中少数「无争议」的原则，删除被支配的行动是化简矩阵的第一步——但要小心，支配的成立依赖于状态的概率不受行动影响，这个前提正是<a href=\"../debates/causal-vs-evidential\">因果与证据决策论</a>争论的焦点。</p>\n<p>当决策不是一锤子买卖而是分阶段展开（先做 A，观察到某状态，再决定 B），矩阵就展开成<strong>决策树</strong>：方形节点是决策点、圆形节点是自然的随机点、叶子是最终结果。用「倒推」（backward induction）从叶子往根算期望效用，就能求出最优策略。决策树是决策分析在医疗、投资中的主力工具，也是强化学习里「状态—动作—回报」结构的雏形，这条线在<a href=\"../practice/decision-theory-in-practice\">应用与边界</a>展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>任何单人决策都可还原为行动、状态、结果三要素，排成决策矩阵；理性选择即「按某规则挑一行」。</li>\n<li>按对状态的了解程度分四档：确定、风险（有概率）、不确定/模糊（无概率）、无知，每档对应不同工具。</li>\n<li>无概率时可用 maximin、maximax、Hurwicz、minimax regret、Laplace 等规则，各自编码一种风险性格，结论可能相互冲突。</li>\n<li>支配原则无需概率即可删除劣行动，但依赖「状态概率不受行动影响」；决策树把序贯决策用倒推求解。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub：<a href=\"../utility/expected-utility\">期望效用理论</a> 处理风险处境的核心工具；<a href=\"../debates/ambiguity-uncertainty\">模糊与奈特不确定性</a> 处理无概率处境；<a href=\"../debates/causal-vs-evidential\">因果与证据决策论</a> 质疑支配原则的前提。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/probability-statistics/random-variables/expectation-variance\">期望与方差</a> 是期望效用计算的数学基础；<a href=\"../../../mathematics-statistics/game-theory/normal-form-and-nash/nash-equilibrium\">纳什均衡</a> 展示当「状态」其实是另一理性主体时结构如何变化。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"决策模型：状态、行动与结果","id":"决策模型-状态-行动与结果"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四种信息处境决定用哪套工具","id":"四种信息处境决定用哪套工具"},{"level":2,"text":"没有概率时的决策规则","id":"没有概率时的决策规则"},{"level":2,"text":"支配、决策树与序贯选择","id":"支配-决策树与序贯选择"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"规范、描述与规定：三种问法之别","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/foundations/normative-vs-descriptive"},"next":{"title":"期望效用理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/philosophy-logic/decision-theory-philosophy/utility/expected-utility"}}